v1.3.14 (2026-06-23)
--------------------
Fix: cascade connections stuck in Connecting / auth error. Also: modals no
longer close on click outside.

- _link_params used AuthType_u32: 3 (certificate auth) for cascade links —
  should be 2 (plain password). This was the root cause of every cascade
  link failing with LastError 4 → 9 (auth errors)
- Cascade tab now auto-polls every 3s while any link is in the Connecting
  state, and stops once all links are connected
- Removed the global click-outside listener that closed modals — it made
  it too easy to lose in-progress form input by misclicking. Escape key
  closes the open modal instead
- Cascade port field changed from a select (limited to local listener
  ports only) to a free number input
